Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:05.13,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.80,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.87,0:00:12.34,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:17.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward! Hands up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:30.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,"I'm almost there, just a little further and I'll have the answer."
