Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:38.42,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:34.31,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(228,508)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:38.42,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790,480)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:45.92,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.69,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,492)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:45.92,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(198,472)}Raw provider\N{\fs40}SOFCJ-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:54.02,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:58.65,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:02.47,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:05.86,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:09.88,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:11.37,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.60,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.04,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.94,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:20.48,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:24.73,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:31.12,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:35.39,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:39.59,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:44.77,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:48.27,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:51.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:54.81,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:59.78,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:03.47,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.72,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:10.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.28,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:14.56,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:15.98,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.78,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.83,0:02:21.54,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:24.99,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:33.83,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\fad(2000,0)}最強的灰熊麥格農與來自德雷斯羅薩的暗殺者！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:38.50,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,200,,距離致命的死國完全填滿實驗室\N只剩五分鐘。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:45.49,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,200,,倖存者們正衝向R棟的66號門，\N那是他們唯一的逃生路線，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:52.25,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,天花板剛剛掀起了一瞬間！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:56.19,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,瓦斯正從裂縫滲進來！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:57.54,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:58.81,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:00.84,Main,Ally,0,0,0,,可是大姐，我好怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:05.03,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂，現在不是慌張的時候，臭小子們！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:06.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,站起來跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:09.25,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.62,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,你平安無事真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.63,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,所以你打敗那個鳥女了，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:15.70,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,可是他們為什麼從前方朝我們跑來？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:18.23,Main,Marine,0,0,0,,我以為他們留下來纏住敵人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:20.67,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,G-5的部隊在我們前面？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:23.10,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,看吧？我就說我們走錯路了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:23.80,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.90,Main,Tashigi,0,0,0,,總之，請把我放下來！這太丟臉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:31.96,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂你！誰他媽准你抱塔西姬的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.31,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,索隆，你跑錯方向了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.25,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,快點，各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:38.66,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:43.97,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(520,0)}B棟二樓－實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:40.82,Main,Marine,0,0,100,,{\an8}天花板要塌了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.97,Main,Marine,0,0,100,,{\an8}喬巴！這地方太危險了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:47.17,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好。我能做的都做了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:48.89,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們趕快去R棟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:54.98,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,撐住，摩卡！我們要離開這裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:03:59.79,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:02.32,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,我明天要怎麼吃早餐？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:05.52,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,這真是個了不起的報仇方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.99,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,我不得不佩服你，羅…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.89,0:04:12.36,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,這真的相當令人惱火。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:15.50,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,但你之後一定會後悔。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:18.10,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,給我記住…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:22.79,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,你對喬卡的過去一無所知。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:25.09,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,那會要了你的命。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:31.13,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,你或許在這個新時代建立了一點名聲，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:35.18,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,但你很容易就能被取代。\N這世界沒有你想的那麼仁慈。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:37.87,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,告訴他，斯莫格。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:43.21,Main,Vergo,0,0,0,,這世界對年輕人來說太複雜了。你光憑一股氣勢往前衝{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:48.77,Main,Law,0,0,0,,你不必擔心我。擔心你自己吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:54.67,Main,Law,0,0,0,,這個房間很快就會完全崩塌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:58.49,Main,Law,0,0,0,,再見了，海賊維爾戈。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:01.83,Captions,Caption,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(375,0)}R棟一樓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:05.92,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,只有一個人能做出這種事…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.22,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:12.29,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,維爾戈到底在搞什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:14.44,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,主人！這是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.78,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,有人被困在瓦礫下面！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:18.26,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:20.62,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:25.20,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,你把我的樂園搞得一團糟！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:28.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,不知道大家是否都平安。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:31.94,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,R棟二樓！聽得到我說話嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:35.48,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,秘密房間，回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:38.08,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,我們在這裡，主人。剛剛發生了什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:40.32,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,立刻打開通氣孔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:46.68,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,讓死國流進這個房間！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.71,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,可…可是如果那樣做的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:51.66,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,我是瓦斯。我不會死。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:53.90,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,明…明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:56.06,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,我會降下電梯去接我們的同伴，然後{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:57.52,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,馬上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:01.11,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,我說了現在馬上去做！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.66,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,所以別磨蹭了，快去做！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:08.08,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,可是下面還有一百多名士兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.06,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,誰他媽在乎，蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:15.85,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,不管你們這些沒用的實驗品死多少，都沒有人會想念你們。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.69,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,你們是社會的人渣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:22.78,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,別再杵在那裡了！聽不到我說話嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.77,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,我想招募多少新部下都行！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:36.59,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,看來他們終於認清凱薩究竟是什麼樣的人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:38.88,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,那是索隆他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.96,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,他們情況不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:48.15,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,能從這裡控制那些門嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:54.39,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,什麼？你為什麼那樣看著我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:57.31,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,喔，沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:01.90,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,當然。我現在懂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:05.80,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,主人只是在演戲，為了騙過敵人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.51,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,喔…喔，原來如此！對，就是這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:15.25,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,那殺人瓦斯一定也是他計畫的一部分。我是說，他真的會傷害自己的部下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:16.79,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,{\i1}當然不會！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:20.75,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,我們怎麼能懷疑善良的主人？我們一定是冒犯他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:24.82,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,主人，通氣孔開了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:31.36,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,殺人瓦斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.40,Main,Gasmask soldier,0,0,0,,它進到建築物裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:35.98,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,這就對了。\N你們一開始就該照我說的做。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.85,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,垃圾不該試圖思考。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:42.97,Main,Caesar,0,0,0,,來吧，成為我的力量，死國！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:55.50,Land of Death,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,0)\pos(1030,170)\frz347.3}死亡之地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:55.67,Land of Death,,0,0,0,,{\frz347.3\pos(1022,136)}死亡之地
